Subject: How to "find" in console output?
Message-ID: <iMpOa7N_TmE.zH2ZDQKz3_gJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/davis-rug/c/iMpOa7N_TmE/m/zH2ZDQKz3_gJ>
